{"id":"verkh","lemma":"верх","pos":"noun","rank":2397,"glosses":["top, upper part, roof, dome, height","summit, apex","the highest degree of something"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c4/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%85.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%85.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"верха","plural":"верхи"},"examples":[{"text":"Где тут верх?","en":"What's the upside to that?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"here"},null]},{"text":"Как попасть на верх башни?","en":"How do we get to the top of the tower?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"to hit"},{"g":"on / at"},null,{"g":"tower","l":"башня"}]},{"text":"Опустите верх автомобиля.","en":"Put the top of your car down.","words":[{"g":"to let down","l":"опустить"},null,{"g":"car","l":"автомобиль"}]},{"text":"Я знал, что одержу верх.","en":"I knew I would win.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"what / that"},null,null]},{"text":"Будь добр, положи эту книгу на самый верх.","en":"Please put this book on the very top.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"to put","l":"положить"},null,null,{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"the very"},null]}]}